Z||000000||Vlad||04-16-2001||12:49 AM||||Hello guys,<P>Yesterday checked one blue 87 Fiero at the lot, and what I saw...........<P>It has a dual V6 exhaust with standard tips and 4 cylinder  4-tech....<P>Now, I don't know something and 4 cylinder engines were offered with dual exhaust or what the heck was that?<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||fyerstarter||04-16-2001||01:06 AM||||It probably just has a muffler and tips off a V6. As you know its not a true dual exhaust, there is one inlet on the muffler and two outs.||||reg||1
